OL,3,GNEWSAChannel sees busiest day of 2026
OL,4,Afor small boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FWednesday was the busiest day of 2026
OL,7,Fso far for small boat crossings,
OL,8,Faccording to provisional Home Office
OL,9,Ffigures.
OL,11,FA total of 781 people arrived across 10
OL,12,Fseparate boats, bringing the cumulative
OL,13,Ftotal for the year so far to 18,565.
OL,15,FThe total is 42% lower than on the
OL,16,Fequivalent date in 2025.
OL,18,FWednesday's figure was the highest
OL,19,Fdaily total since 803 people arrived on
OL,20,F20 December 2025.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
